    "created_at": "2025-04-07T10:57:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-07T10:57:25Z",
    "body": "> We can lift this restriction when there is sufficiently low compat risk, which we estimate may be in ~5 years time.\n\n(If not everyone ships this might have to be prolonged.)",
