    "created_at": "2025-04-07T13:14:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-07T13:14:17Z",
    "body": "My preference is to change this sooner rather than later, so that authors can omit `type` sooner and not need a polyfill that only adds `type=button` to make things work in 2025..2030 era browsers in 2035.\n\nIf we change this when `command` is shipping in Gecko, WebKit and Chromium, that seems acceptable and hopefully will be less than 5 years.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
