    "created_at": "2025-04-07T14:03:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-07T14:03:25Z",
    "body": "One thing that Simon mentioned before is that we can probably actually lift this restriction in half the time we think we need. Because people won't be able to use the implicit type behaviour once it's launched (as very recent browsers would no-op). They'll have to wait until a while afterwards, at which point the browsers that would submit forms would be quite old.",
